      "jp": "はぁ、はぁっ……なんとか逃げ切りましたね。\nそれに、ほら。祠がありますよ。",
      "jp_sha256": "c5a9f0b2d69b93f8aae9b198d4df9d9eff7265f062dcd18e88343329852ce566",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "하아, 하아…… 어떻게든 따돌렸네요.\n그리고 보세요. 사당이 있어요.",
      "message_index_0based": 0,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 17,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
